OL,3,AWhy is the Microsoft outage lasting so
OL,4,Along?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major global Microsoft outage has
OL,7,Fcaused problems, or in some cases
OL,8,Fdisabled entire services, including
OL,9,Femails and artificial intelligence
OL,10,Fproducts.
OL,12,FEfforts to completely resume services
OL,13,Fremain ongoing.
OL,15,FMicrosoft said the outage was not
OL,16,Fcaused by a cyber-security incident.
OL,18,FHere's what we know about the services
OL,19,Faffected and what went wrong.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
